{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達股價錄得逾18個月來最差單周表現，這家晶片巨頭在黃仁勳離職後持續承壓。英偉達周五下跌2%，收於162.85美元，過去五個交易日累計下跌13%，創2025年4月以來最大單周跌幅，當時美國總統當勞·特朗普宣佈大範圍徵收關税的計劃，引發全球市場震蕩。這也是英偉達連續第六周下跌，為2012年以來最長連跌。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586328.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T23:09:26.322655+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T22:52:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T23:02:33.144475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T23:02:33.144475+00:00","content_hash":"b98e930c4d54a398376dcdc03b271422c7a5273d62ca4d1eb1b84c24f61a16e0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}